.TH PO-TRANSLATE 1 "February 2026" "po-translate 1.5.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
po\-translate \- machine\-translate PO files using multiple backends
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B po\-translate
\fB\-s\fR \fISOURCE\fR [\fB\-t\fR \fITARGET\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIPATHS\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBpo\-translate\fR translates untranslated entries in PO (gettext) files
using machine translation services. It supports multiple backends
including free services (Lingva, MyMemory), self\-hosted (LibreTranslate),
and commercial APIs (DeepL, Google, OpenAI, Anthropic).
.PP
Only empty (untranslated) msgstr entries are translated. Existing
translations are never overwritten. Translated entries are automatically
marked as fuzzy for human review.
.PP
Exit codes: 0 = success, 1 = translation errors, 2 = usage error.
.SH POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I PATHS
PO files or directories containing PO files. Directories are searched
recursively unless \fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR is set.
.SH REQUIRED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-source\fR \fILANG\fR
Source language code (e.g., \fBen\fR, \fBde\fR, \fBfr\fR). This is
the language of the original msgid strings. Required.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-target\fR \fILANG\fR
Target language code (e.g., \fBsv\fR, \fBde\fR, \fBfr\fR). If omitted,
defaults to the system locale (LANG environment variable).
.TP
\fB\-\-service\fR \fISERVICE\fR
Translation backend. Choices:
.RS
.TP
\fBlingva\fR (default)
Free, no API key required. Uses Lingva Translate public instances.
Good for most European languages.
.TP
\fBmymemory\fR
Free tier (1000 words/day). Uses MyMemory Translation Memory API.
.TP
\fBlibretranslate\fR
Self\-hosted or public LibreTranslate instance. Use \fB\-\-url\fR to
specify your server URL.
.TP
\fBdeepl\fR
DeepL Pro API. Requires \fB\-\-api\-key\fR. High\-quality translations
for supported languages.
.TP
\fBdeepl\-free\fR
DeepL Free API. Requires \fB\-\-api\-key\fR. Limited to 500,000
characters/month.
.TP
\fBgoogle\fR
Google Cloud Translation API. Requires \fB\-\-api\-key\fR.
.TP
\fBopenai\fR
OpenAI GPT models. Requires \fB\-\-api\-key\fR. Use \fB\-\-model\fR to
select model (default: gpt\-4o\-mini).
.TP
\fBanthropic\fR
Anthropic Claude models. Requires \fB\-\-api\-key\fR. Use \fB\-\-model\fR
to select model (default: claude\-3\-haiku\-20240307).
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\fR \fIKEY\fR
API key for paid services (DeepL, Google, OpenAI, Anthropic). Can also
be set via environment variables: DEEPL_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY,
OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fIURL\fR
Custom server URL for LibreTranslate. Example:
\fBhttp://localhost:5000\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fIMODEL\fR
Model name for AI services. Examples: \fBgpt\-4o\-mini\fR,
\fBclaude\-3\-haiku\-20240307\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-batch\-size\fR \fIN\fR
Number of entries per API call. Higher values are faster but may hit
rate limits. Default: 10.
.TP
\fB\-\-glossary\fR \fIFILE\fR
CSV glossary file for custom terminology. Format: one \fIsource,target\fR
pair per line. Glossary terms override machine translations.
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be translated without saving changes. Useful for
previewing translations before committing.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR
Do not search subdirectories for PO files.
.TP
\fB\-j\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Output results as JSON for scripting.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-essential output. Only errors are shown.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show detailed progress including each entry being translated.
.TP
\fB\-\-about\fR
Show application info (name, version, author, license) and exit.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show version number and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All entries translated successfully.
.TP
.B 1
Some entries failed to translate (partial success).
.TP
.B 2
Usage error (invalid arguments, missing required options).
.SH EXAMPLES
Translate all PO files using the free Lingva service:
.PP
.RS
.nf
po\-translate \-s en \-t sv po/
.fi
.RE
.PP
Use DeepL with an API key:
.PP
.RS
.nf
po\-translate \-s en \-t de \-\-service deepl \-\-api\-key YOUR_KEY po/
.fi
.RE
.PP
Translate with a custom glossary:
.PP
.RS
.nf
po\-translate \-s en \-t sv \-\-glossary terms.csv myapp.po
.fi
.RE
.PP
Dry\-run with JSON output:
.PP
.RS
.nf
po\-translate \-s en \-t sv \-\-dry\-run \-\-json po/sv.po
.fi
.RE
.PP
Use OpenAI GPT\-4 for high\-quality translations:
.PP
.RS
.nf
po\-translate \-s en \-t sv \-\-service openai \-\-model gpt\-4o \-\-api\-key $OPENAI_API_KEY po/
.fi
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DEEPL_API_KEY
API key for DeepL translation service.
.TP
.B OPENAI_API_KEY
API key for OpenAI.
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
API key for Anthropic Claude.
.TP
.B GOOGLE_API_KEY
API key for Google Cloud Translation.
